.space.lg","web":"--tm-space-page","value":16,"via":"--tm-space-lg"}],"decided":[{"id":"d01","q":"What does the mobile field accept, and how are typed or pasted numbers cleaned?"},{"id":"d02","q":"Which checks run, in what order, and when does each error appear?"},{"id":"d03","q":"When does an error clear?"},{"id":"d04","q":"Where do errors show, and what does the field look like in error?"},{"id":"d05","q":"What can the server answer after Send OTP, and how is each answer shown?"},{"id":"d06","q":"Does a server answer stay when the doctor edits the number?"},{"id":"d28","q":"What colour is the placeholder text in the field?"},{"id":"o06","q":"When the \"Try again in m:ss\" countdown ends, does the notice stay or go?"},{"id":"o13","q":"Which token is the busy spinner's ring?"},{"id":"o14","q":"react-native-svg may not draw the image the logo SVG embeds. What do we use on the phone?"},{"id":"o20","q":"Is a server notice 8 or 16 below the field?"},{"id":"d29","q":"Border widths, the focus ring, icon and spinner sizes and the logo width: are there tokens?"},{"id":"d27","q":"Can a field error and a server notice show at the same time?"},{"id":"d07","q":"What happens to the button and the field while the code is being sent?"},{"id":"d08","q":"Too many attempts: what does the button show, and how long is the wait?"},{"id":"d09","q":"Which limits are enforced on the server and which in the app?"},{"id":"d10","q":"What happens when the doctor signs in with a number that is locked?"},{"id":"d11","q":"The account is inactive: what does the doctor see and what does the button do?"},{"id":"d12","q":"Where does \"Sign up\" go, and what happens for a number that isn't registered?"},{"id":"d13","q":"Does the keyboard open by itself on Sign-in, and where is Send OTP when it is open?"},{"id":"d31","q":"How is the space between things measured, and which gaps are allowed?"},{"id":"d32","q":"What is the band at the top of Sign-in, OTP, the offer, unlock and Home?"},{"id":"d30","q":"On a phone, can the keyboard ever cover the number field or Send OTP?"},{"id":"d14","q":"Which keyboard type and autofill hint does the field use?"},{"id":"d15","q":"What happens to the keyboard and the sign-up line when a server answer arrives or the keyboard is open?"},{"id":"d16","q":"What happens when the doctor taps Send OTP while offline?"},{"id":"d17","q":"Where does every word on the screen come from? Can I change copy?"},{"id":"d18","q":"Is it \"case\" or \"order\"?"},{"id":"d19","q":"What are the logo size and the spacing at the top of the screen?"},{"id":"d20","q":"Which type sizes does the screen use?"},{"id":"d21","q":"What are the accessibility rules (targets, contrast, focus, names)?"},{"id":"d22","q":"Which font, which weights?"},{"id":"d23","q":"Can I use a hex colour, a palette colour or a pixel value that matches a token?"},{"id":"d24","q":"How many primary buttons, and what do the button labels look like?"},{"id":"d25","q":"Where does Sign-in sit in the app, and where does it go next?"},{"id":"d26","q":"How do notices wrap and where do they sit?"},{"id":"o01","q":"How long are the OTP issue window, the number lock and the code life in production?"},{"id":"o02","q":"How long is the \"Try again in m:ss\" wait after too many attempts?"},{"id":"o03","q":"Send OTP again for the same number while the resend wait is still running: what does the server answer?"},{"id":"o04","q":"More than 10 digits that aren't a +91 or 0 prefix: cut silently or show a message?"},{"id":"o05","q":"Should Sign-in show an offline notice before the doctor taps Send OTP (passive offline)?"},{"id":"o07","q":"Is the logo's 16 from the top measured from the screen edge or from the safe area (status bar, notch)?"},{"id":"o08","q":"Android back gesture on Sign-in (the first screen): leave the app, or stay?"},{"id":"o09","q":"The prototype draws a number keyboard in its pictures. Do we draw one?"},{"id":"o10","q":"Coming back from OTP (Change): is the number kept, and does the first typed digit replace it?"},{"id":"o11","q":"Terms, Privacy and support links: final URLs, and where are they configured?"},{"id":"o15","q":"Send OTP API: endpoint, request and the shape of each answer (sent, locked, not registered, couldn't send, too many attempts, inactive). Does \"too many attempts\" return an end time or seconds left?"},{"id":"o16","q":"How long does the app wait for Send OTP before showing \"Couldn't send the code.\"?"},{"id":"o17","q":"On the phone, does Sign up open the system browser or a browser inside the app?"},{"id":"o18","q":"If the doctor changes the number and then types the old one back, should its earlier answer (too many attempts, inactive) show again without a new Send OTP?"},{"id":"o19","q":"Some web styles have no native equivalent: balanced line breaks for titles and notices (iOS), the subtitle's 31-character width limit, and the 2px focus ring for hardware keyboards. Drop or approximate?"},{"id":"o21","q":"Is \"New to Truemeds? Sign up\" a link inside a sentence (exempt from the 48 tap target) or a standalone link (48 tall)?"},{"id":"o22","q":"Should text grow with the phone's font-size setting (dynamic type), and is there a dark mode?"},{"id":"o23","q":"Expo or bare React Native CLI, and which navigation library?"},{"id":"o24","q":"How fast does the busy spinner turn, and does it stop when the phone's reduce-motion setting is on?"},{"id":"o25","q":"\"New to Truemeds?\" and \"Sign up\" are two copy entries; the space between them is typed in code. One entry with a {link} placeholder instead?"},{"id":"o26","q":"What does \"Call Doctor Ops\" do on a device that can't make calls (tablet, no SIM)?"},{"id":"o12","q":"How long does a signed-in session last before OTP is asked again?"},{"id":"otp-01","q":"What is the rule for \"4 digits, keyboard opens on load and stays open\"?"},{"id":"otp-02","q":"What is the rule for \"The terms line stays during Verifying… and Checking…, so\"?"},{"id":"otp-03","q":"What is the rule for \"Layout (D-1